    <button aria-checked=false aria-label="Remind me to complete a check-in" className="toggle" disabled=false role="switch" type="button">
<section className="card">
  <h2 className="card__title">
    "Privacy & data"
  <div className="row row--between">
    <span className="note" style={"whiteSpace":"pre-wrap"}>
      "Third-party transcript translation is off."
    <button aria-checked=false aria-label="Third-party transcript translation is off." className="toggle" disabled=false role="switch" type="button">
  <p className="note note--muted" style={"whiteSpace":"pre-wrap"}>
    "Non-English voice transcripts are sent as soon as they are recorded to Approved translation provider for English translation. Provider retention: Transient processing. Policy fingerprint: translation-policy-3. Journal pattern analysis is not active."
  <hr className="divider">
  <span className="section-label">
    "Voice journaling"
  <div className="row row--between">
    <span className="note" style={"whiteSpace":"pre-wrap"}>
      "Voice journaling off"
    <button aria-checked=false aria-label="Voice journaling off" className="toggle" disabled=false role="switch" type="button">
  <p className="note note--muted" style={"whiteSpace":"pre-wrap"}>
    "When you stop recording—before you save the journal entry—the recording is uploaded to Approved audio provider for transcription. Provider retention: Transient transcription. Policy fingerprint: audio-policy-3. Recordings you choose to keep are stored encrypted for 30 days."
  <hr className="divider">
  <div className="row row--wrap">
    <button className="btn btn--ghost btn--small" disabled=false type="button">
      "Download export (encrypted)"
  <p className="note note--muted" style={"whiteSpace":"pre-wrap"}>
    "The bundle is ciphertext — safe to store anywhere, unreadable without your password."
  <p className="note note--muted" style={"whiteSpace":"pre-wrap"}>
    "Recovery kits are created and managed in the mobile app. Open Settings there to create, replace, or remove one."
  <p className="note note--warn" style={"whiteSpace":"pre-wrap"}>
    "Offline saving works after this web app is already loaded. Starting or reloading the browser app requires a connection."
<section className="card">
  <h2 className="card__title">
    "Who accessed your data"
  <p className="note" style={"whiteSpace":"pre-wrap"}>
    "No recorded access beyond your own yet."
<section className="card">
  <h2 className="card__title">
    "Change password"
  <p className="note note--muted" style={"whiteSpace":"pre-wrap"}>
    "Re-encrypts your entire journal under the new password, re-wraps every therapist grant, and signs out every device — including the mobile app."
  <label className="field">
    <span className="field__label">
      "New password"
    <input autoComplete="new-password" className="input" type="password" value="">
  <label className="field">
    <span className="field__label">
      "Confirm new password"
    <input autoComplete="new-password" className="input" type="password" value="">
  <button className="btn" disabled=false type="button">
    "Change password"
<section className="card">
