    "Recovery kits are created and managed in the mobile app. Open Settings there to create, replace, or remove one."
  <p className="note note--warn" style={"whiteSpace":"pre-wrap"}>
    "Offline saving works after this web app is already loaded. Starting or reloading the browser app requires a connection."
<section className="card">
  <h2 className="card__title">
    "Who accessed your data"
  <p className="note" style={"whiteSpace":"pre-wrap"}>
    "No recorded access beyond your own yet."
<section className="card">
  <h2 className="card__title">
    "Change password"
  <p className="note note--muted" style={"whiteSpace":"pre-wrap"}>
    "Re-encrypts your entire journal under the new password, re-wraps every therapist grant, and signs out every device — including the mobile app."
  <label className="field">
    <span className="field__label">
      "New password"
    <input autoComplete="new-password" className="input" type="password" value="">
  <label className="field">
    <span className="field__label">
      "Confirm new password"
    <input autoComplete="new-password" className="input" type="password" value="">
  <button className="btn" disabled=false type="button">
    "Change password"
<section className="card">
  <h2 className="card__title">
    "Upgrade key protection"
  <p className="note note--muted" style={"whiteSpace":"pre-wrap"}>
    "Optional, one-time: keeps your existing journal key exactly as it is, but stores it in the newer locker that makes future password changes instant (no re-encryption, no waiting). Nothing about what you or your therapist can see changes."
  <label className="field">
    <span className="field__label">
      "Current password (to authorize the upgrade)"
    <input autoComplete="current-password" className="input" type="password" value="">
  <button className="btn" disabled=true type="button">
    "Upgrade key protection"
<section className="card card--danger">
  <h2 className="card__title">
    "Delete account"
  <p className="note note--danger" style={"whiteSpace":"pre-wrap"}>
    "Removes you and the full cascade: entries, patterns, questions, measures, sharing grants. Only the access audit log survives (metadata, no content). This cannot be undone."
  <label className="field">
    <span className="field__label">
      "Type DELETE to confirm"
    <input autoComplete="off" className="input" type="text" value="">
  <button className="btn btn--danger" disabled=true type="button">
    "Delete my account""
`;

